{"2856750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Aliro1", "steam_appid": 2856750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cure Crafter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devise illicit nano-alchemies to cure unknown sicknesses as you trade with ghosts and man alike in the world's black markets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>One Wrong Mix, and You're the Plague...</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Live the life of a Wandering Alchemist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge through remnants of broken societies where resources are scarce, but there is always hope for help. In <strong>Aliro1</strong>, a casual Crafting &amp; Exploration RPG, you’ll navigate domestic and foreign planets while unearthing the mysteries of your past.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemy crafting mechanics taken from modern and ancient Chemistry concepts &amp; ideas.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Exploration:</strong> Venture into both peaceful &amp; dangerous planets filled with rich lore, small communities, and recipes to experiment with. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be the light in the dark...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe has been engulfed in darkness, be the light and uncover your fate in <strong>Aliro1</strong>.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cure Crafter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devise illicit nano-alchemies to cure unknown sicknesses as you trade with ghosts and man alike in the world's black markets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>One Wrong Mix, and You're the Plague...</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Live the life of a Wandering Alchemist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge through remnants of broken societies where resources are scarce, but there is always hope for help. In <strong>Aliro1</strong>, a casual Crafting &amp; Exploration RPG, you’ll navigate domestic and foreign planets while unearthing the mysteries of your past.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemy crafting mechanics taken from modern and ancient Chemistry concepts &amp; ideas.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Exploration:</strong> Venture into both peaceful &amp; dangerous planets filled with rich lore, small communities, and recipes to experiment with. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be the light in the dark...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe has been engulfed in darkness, be the light and uncover your fate in <strong>Aliro1</strong>.</p>", "short_description": "A Sci-Fi Crafting RPG about a traveling Alchemist finding cures. One wrong mix, and you're the plague... Let's hope it doesn't come to that, trade and sell with the black markets of the world to help people in need.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Latin America, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856750/18ea153ffd44c2231361344e0ec8456b1bdd98b0/header.jpg?t=1786465063", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856750/850d724a2be5195d8d4ad3c75cd13c1d2fcc7476/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786465063", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856750/850d724a2be5195d8d4ad3c75cd13c1d2fcc7476/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786465063", "website": "https://www.youtube.com/@IcarusGG", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5, 3rd gen (or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br